---
import Catalogue from '../layouts/Catalogue.astro';
---

<Catalogue title="Privacy & analytics — LVTD Games">
  <h1>Privacy &amp; analytics</h1>
  <p>
    We use PostHog to understand visits, game choices, play sessions, results,
    sharing actions, loading performance, and errors. An anonymous browser ID
    stored on this site helps us count returning visitors across our games.
  </p>
  <p>
    Analytics events do not include your name, email, phrases, guessed words,
    board contents, or URL query strings. We do not record sessions, keyboard
    input, or screen contents. We disable IP-based location enrichment.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can disable analytics below. We also respect Do Not Track and Global
    Privacy Control. Playing works with analytics disabled or blocked.
  </p>
  <button data-analytics-opt-out>Disable analytics in this browser</button>
  <p>
    Corporate BS Meter separately stores submitted phrases and scores for public
    results and its leaderboard. A nickname is optional. An email is saved only
    when you choose game updates; it is never public. Other games keep their
    progress or settings in your browser.
  </p>
  <a href="/">← Back to games</a>
</Catalogue>
<style>
  p {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  button {
    padding: 16px 24px;
    font: inherit;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--purple);
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  button:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--lavender);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
</style>
